          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekaŋ iyes ŋulu iyeete ŋikisila ŋulu nyiyookino,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Totubokinae ŋituŋa ka Asiriya ŋulu esupasi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okoe iyes ŋituŋa ka Asiriya! Anaŋoit kaŋ,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kedau Ekapolon akitiya etic keŋ daadaŋ alomukura a Sion ka alo Yerusalem, isicani iŋes erwosit ka Asiriya aŋuna ka akisupa ka akituro keŋ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nai irworo Ekapolon ebala,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ŋipiya a Ŋisirael ŋulu apotu tokiwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, nyikinyomete nabo ŋipiya a Ŋisirael ka ŋulu aponi nyeari aloletok a Yakob ekepukan ŋolo abu toar ikes, nai epote ikes akikinyom anakiro a ŋuna a kire Ekapolon, Akuj ŋina asegan ŋina a Isirael. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eboŋunete ŋipiya, eboŋunete ŋipiya a ŋiletok a Yakob neni ka Akuj a ŋina etiron. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tari ŋina sek alalaata ŋituŋa a Isirael atyaakatar elalak asinyon alokipetot a anam, ŋituŋa ŋulu erae ŋipiya bon eboŋunete. Alimun ŋuna ka amunyaro, ido acamut ŋituŋa akisicanio anakiyookino; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae Ekapolon Akuj ŋina a ŋajoresyo iŋes itasaluni ibore daadaŋ lopite ŋolo alimunio iŋes aŋuna ka akwap daadaŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋun alimu Ekapolon, Akuj ŋina a ŋajoresyo ebe, “Okoe ŋituŋa kaŋ ŋulu iboiyete alo Sion, nyikuryaketa aŋuna a ŋituŋa ka Asiriya a ŋulu ikisicanito iyes, a ŋulu ikitiŋakinito iyes ŋibelae ikimanito lopite ŋolo ikimanitotor iyes Ŋijipitian; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anerae alotooma apaki ŋina euruwuana ajoŋoe ayoŋ aŋoikinit iyes ka eruwor ikes anyunyurikin ayoŋ omunya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayoŋ Ekapolon ŋolo a ŋajoresyo adai ikes a adaset lopite ŋolo abunio odaiya ŋituŋa a Midian anataaba a Oreb; esicani ayoŋ ŋituŋa ŋulu eya nanamyo, lopite ŋolo abunio esicania ŋituŋa a Ijipit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 10:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akoloŋit ŋin, alemari ayoŋ ŋican ŋulu iryamunito iyes aneni a erwosit ka Asiriya, elemaryo ŋican aneni kus lopite ŋolo elemarere ayokot alomosiriŋ.” Itiyakin ŋun, anerae arotoki erwosit ka Asiriya alo Rimon,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.10.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.10.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
